OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CMan who studied drama in young         
OL,5,Coffenders' institution now a West End  
OL,6,Cactor                                  
OL,7,GA former young offender who became a   
OL,8,GWest End actor says taking drama       
OL,9,Glessons while he was detained was the  
OL,10,Gbest decision he ever made.            
OL,12,FJoseph Langdon, who grew up in south   
OL,13,FLondon, was convicted of gang-related  
OL,14,Fcrimes at the the age of 16. But while 
OL,15,Fin a young offenders' institution, he  
OL,16,Fwas offered drama lessons through a    
OL,17,Fscheme with the Bristol Old Vic.       
OL,19,FLangdon said the lessons taught him    
OL,20,F"that I could make something of my     
OL,21,Flife, and introduced me to this world  
OL,22,FI did not think was possible".    G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
